### =========================================================================
### 🌐 PRODUCTION — https://api.nelson1869.com (Day 36)
### 📅 Day 36 · Phase 8 (Totoong deploy) · in-update sa Day 36b (frontend, no-store)
### =========================================================================
### Totoong internet: phone/browser → Cloudflare (HTTPS) → named Tunnel →
### cloudflared (PC) → backend container → Neon (Singapore).
###
### ⚠️ PRODUCTION ITO — basahin lang (health, CORS). HUWAG gumawa ng test users
### dito: totoong database ito. Ang mga pagsubok na may register/login ay sa
### ../01–07 (localhost, dev database).
###
### Kailangang tumatakbo: cd devops && docker compose -f docker-compose.prod.yml up -d
### Code: devops/docker-compose.prod.yml · devops/cloudflared/config.yml
### =========================================================================

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. Health mula sa internet. Ang inaasahan:
###    Status:   200 OK
###    Headers:  server: cloudflare · cf-ray: ...-SIN (dumaan sa Cloudflare, Singapore)
###    Body:     { "status": "ok", "time": "..." }
###
### 🔍 Walang bukas na port sa router — kumokonekta PALABAS ang cloudflared.
GET https://api.nelson1869.com/api/health

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. CORS preflight mula sa totoong frontend (Day 36b). Ang inaasahan:
###    Status:   204
###    Headers:  access-control-allow-origin: https://nelson1869.com
###              access-control-allow-credentials: true
OPTIONS https://api.nelson1869.com/api/auth/login
Origin: https://nelson1869.com
Access-Control-Request-Method: POST
Access-Control-Request-Headers: content-type

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. CORS preflight mula sa dev frontend (localhost:5173). Ang inaasahan:
###    Status:   204, pero allow-origin ay https://nelson1869.com pa rin
###    → HAHARANGIN ng browser: hindi puwedeng gamitin ang production API mula sa dev
OPTIONS https://api.nelson1869.com/api/auth/login
Origin: http://localhost:5173
Access-Control-Request-Method: POST

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. http:// (walang S). Ang inaasahan (kapag naka-ON ang "Always Use HTTPS"):
###    Status:   301 → Location: https://api.nelson1869.com/api/health  (sinubukan: ✅ Day 36)
###    🔐 Kung 200: dadaan ang password nang hindi naka-encrypt — i-ON sa Cloudflare
###    (SSL/TLS → Edge Certificates → Always Use HTTPS)
GET http://api.nelson1869.com/api/health

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5. /me nang walang cookie — at HINDI naka-cache. Ang inaasahan:
###    Status:   401
###    Headers:  cache-control: no-store · cf-cache-status: DYNAMIC
###    🔐 Hindi kailanman itatago ng CDN ang personal na data
GET https://api.nelson1869.com/api/auth/me

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 6. Frontend (Cloudflare Pages). Ang inaasahan:
###    Status:   200 · cache-control: no-cache (index.html)
###    Sa browser: register → login → Profile "Hello, …!" (sinubukan sa iPhone 13 screen, Day 36b)
GET https://nelson1869.com/

